!tests/data/*.jsonl
kinetica-journal-*
shots/
*.perf
perf.data*

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Claude Code: a person's own settings and notes
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# The guide's pictures: the editor photographs itself (tools/ui_guide_shots.py). They live in the guide's own
# repository, kinetica-docs, where tools/build_site.py puts them - 11 MB that would grow with every retake.
/docs/images/ui/
